                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="note_swap" value="⚠ BICYCLE MODEL SWAP TARGETS:&lt;br&gt;• [UGV.n?] quadrotor.n: 14 → 4&lt;br&gt;• [UGV.m?] quadrotor.m: 4 → 1&lt;br&gt;• A [14×14] → A_lat [4×4]&lt;br&gt;• B [14×4] → B_lat [4×1]&lt;br&gt;• Comment out Γ(, G_inv, f_k (rotational dynamics)&lt;br&gt;• Comment out g_barrier (roll/pitch/thrust checks)&lt;br&gt;• Comment out M [4×4] mixer&lt;br&gt;• New control: δf (front wheel steer angle)&lt;br&gt;• New states: y, ẏ, Ψ, Ψ̇&amp;nbsp;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=#d6b656;fillColor=#fffde7;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="820" y="410" width="350" height="290" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="note_params" value="⚠ System_params.txt changes:&lt;br&gt;• Remove: cT, moment_arm&lt;br&gt;• Remove: phi_max, theta_max, T_min/max&lt;br&gt;• Add: Cf (front cornering stiffness)&lt;br&gt;• Add: Cr (rear cornering stiffness)&lt;br&gt;• Add: lf (a), lr (b) (axle distances)&lt;br&gt;• Add: v_x (longitudinal speed)&lt;br&gt;• n=4, m=1 → A[4×4], B[4×1]" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=#d6b656;fillColor=#fffde7;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="820" y="70" width="280" height="200" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="note_thread" value="⚠ Thread architecture notes:&#xa;• pose_lock: replace 18-element pose[] with&#xa;  UGV state (x,y,yaw,speed)&#xa;• path_lock: unchanged (2D waypoints)&#xa;• Separate PI speed thread&#xa;  (longitudinal decoupled)&#xa;• trajectory_lock: unchanged" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=#d6b656;fillColor=#fffde7;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="820" y="840" width="280" height="170" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
